# Docker only

The app runs in Docker. Do not start the API, Vite, or Postgres in a terminal, and do not rebuild containers yourself. See the no-container-rebuilds rule.

- The UI is https://localhost. The API listens inside the `api` container. Do not run `pnpm start:dev`, `pnpm dev`, or a second Vite server.
- Postgres is the `postgres` service. Schema changes ship in the image; the API container runs `prisma migrate deploy` on start. Do not start another database or apply migrations from the host.
